#: kreversi.cpp:224
msgid ""
"You are already running an unfinished game.  If you abort the old game to start "
"a new one, the old game will be registered as a loss in the highscore file.\n"
"What do you want to do?"
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले पहिल्यै नसकिएको खेल चलाइरहनु भएको छ ।  यदि तपाईँले नयाँ खेल सुरु गर्न "
"पुरानो खेल परित्याग गरेमा, पुरानो खेल उच्चस्कोर फाइलमा हारेको सूचीमा दर्ता "
"गरिन्छ ।\n"
"तपाईँले के गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ?"

#: kreversi.cpp:229
msgid "Abort Current Game?"
msgstr "हालको खेल परित्याग गर्नुहुन्छ?"

#: kreversi.cpp:230
msgid "Abort Old Game"
msgstr "पुरानो खेल परित्याग गर्नुहोस्"

#: kreversi.cpp:231
msgid "Continue Old Game"
msgstr "पुरानो खेल जारी राख्नुहोस्"

#: kreversi.cpp:281
msgid "Game saved."
msgstr "खेल बचत गरियो ।"

#: kreversi.cpp:386
msgid "You cannot switch sides in the middle of the computer's move."
msgstr "तपाईँले कम्प्युटरले चालेको बेलामा छेउमा स्विच गर्न सक्नुहुन्न ।"

#: kreversi.cpp:387
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "सूचना"

#: kreversi.cpp:394
msgid "If you switch side, your score will not be added to the highscores."
msgstr ""
"यदि तपाईँले छेउमा स्विच गर्नु भएमा, तपाईँको प्राप्ताङ्क उच्च प्राप्ताङ्कमा "
"थपिदैन ।"

#: kreversi.cpp:466
msgid "Your turn"
msgstr "तपाईँको पालो"

#: kreversi.cpp:468
msgid "Computer's turn"
msgstr "कम्प्युटरको पालो"

#: kreversi.cpp:473
msgid " (interrupted)"
msgstr " (अवरोध गरिएको)"

#: kreversi.cpp:586
msgid "Illegal move"
msgstr "अवैध चाल"

#: kreversi.cpp:599
msgid "End of game"
msgstr "खेलको अन्त्य"

#: kreversi.cpp:610
msgid "Draw!"
msgstr "बराबर!"

#: kreversi.cpp:611
msgid ""
"Game is drawn!\n"
"\n"
"You     : %1\n"
"Computer: %2"
msgstr ""
"खेल बराबर भएको छ!\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँ     : %1\n"
"कम्प्युटर: %2"

#: kreversi.cpp:613 kreversi.cpp:620 kreversi.cpp:627
msgid "Game Ended"
msgstr "खेल सकियो"

#: kreversi.cpp:617
msgid "Game won!"
msgstr "खेल जित्नु भयो!"

#: kreversi.cpp:618
msgid ""
"Congratulations, you have won!\n"
"\n"
"You     : %1\n"
"Computer: %2"
msgstr ""
"बधाई छ, तपाईँले जित्नु भयो!\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँ     : %1\n"
"कम्प्युटर: %2"

#: kreversi.cpp:624
msgid "Game lost!"
msgstr "खेल हार्नु भयो!"

#: kreversi.cpp:625
msgid ""
"You have lost the game!\n"
"\n"
"You     : %1\n"
"Computer: %2"
msgstr ""
"तपाईँले खेल हार्नु भयो!\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँ     : %1\n"
"कम्प्युटर: %2"

